mini_graphormer/

    An independent reimplementation. Parameter naming deliberately mirrors
    Microsoft's Graphormer (https://github.com/microsoft/Graphormer,
    MIT licensed) so that the officially released pcqm4mv2_graphormer_base
    checkpoints load without remapping. No Microsoft source is copied.

